  "privacyTitle": "Privacy Policy",
  "privacyUpdated": "Last updated: 23 July 2026",
  "privacyS1Title": "No data leaves your device",
  "privacyS1Body": "Kothabhada is a fully offline app. It has no account, no servers and no analytics. Every house, room, tenant, reading, payment and document you enter is stored only in the app's private storage on this device.",
  "privacyS2Title": "Camera & photos",
  "privacyS2Body": "The camera and file access are used solely to attach meter photos and documents that you choose. These images are saved on-device and are never uploaded anywhere.",
  "privacyS3Title": "Notifications",
  "privacyS3Body": "Rent reminders are scheduled locally on your device. No reminder information is sent over the internet.",
  "privacyS4Title": "Backups you control",
  "privacyS4Body": "When you export a backup, a single file is created that you choose where to share or store. The app does not transmit this file on its own — you are fully in control of it.",
  "privacyS5Title": "Security",
  "privacyS5Body": "Your PIN is stored only on this device as a salted hash and never leaves it. Biometric unlock is handled by your device's operating system.",
  "privacyS6Title": "Deleting your data",
  "privacyS6Body": "Uninstalling the app removes all of its data from your device. There is nothing stored elsewhere to delete.",
  "privacyFooter": "Because Kothabhada does not collect or transmit any personal data, there is no data to request, correct or delete from any server."
